00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:35.188
Donald Trump's like a mob boss.

00:07:35.188 --> 00:07:37.323
I used to prosecute actual mafiosos

00:07:37.323 --> 00:07:38.724
here in New York City.

00:07:38.724 --> 00:07:40.226
And as I went back through my old cases,

00:07:40.226 --> 00:07:41.661
I saw so many similarities

00:07:41.661 --> 00:07:42.895
between the tactics

00:07:42.895 --> 00:07:44.730
they use, the intimidation tactics,

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.699
the way that they know how to say things

00:07:46.699 --> 00:07:48.301
without quite saying them

00:07:48.301 --> 00:07:49.769
send a signal to people.

00:07:49.769 --> 00:07:50.470
And Donald Trump,

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:51.971
we see using the same tactics.

00:07:51.971 --> 00:07:52.305
And I think

00:07:52.305 --> 00:07:53.940
that's frustrated prosecutors.

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:54.307
But also,

00:07:54.307 --> 00:07:55.174
I argue prosecutors

00:07:55.174 --> 00:07:56.075
haven't stepped up to the

00:07:56.075 --> 00:07:57.477
challenge adequately.

